Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 22:45:44 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(kanban): retain full authorship for unproven replacement
 artifacts [daveey]

Replacement PR identity and unattributed range commits cannot release historical implementers. Fall back to full implementation history, retaining review-run and proven no-code rehandoff classification. Missing ranges stay fail closed; complete attributable same-PR disjoint ranges retain narrowing.

Proof: independent reviewer probe b0e6cd5bafeb red on 49d350bd3e (1 failed), green after fix. Canonical 18-file consumer suite: 497 passed. Five focused mutants killed, including uncovered commits and replacement PR without old range. Read-only local/replica replay: 52 artifact histories, one broadened run set, no removals. Full scripts/check needs canonical rebase: unrelated tree-group health ratchet on stale base.
